OL,3,GNEWSASenior judge to review trial of
OL,4,Athe facts after Donaldson case
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former senior judge will carry out a
OL,7,Freview of the legal framework on trial
OL,8,Fof the facts cases in Northern Ireland
OL,9,Fin the wake of the Donaldson trial.
OL,11,FEleanor Donaldson, wife of convicted
OL,12,Fsex offender Jeffrey Donaldson, had
OL,13,Ffaced a trial of the facts after being
OL,14,Ffound unfit for a conventional trial on
OL,15,Fmental health grounds.
OL,17,FSir John Gillen, who led a major review
OL,18,Fof sexual offence trials in 2019, is
OL,19,Fexpected to deliver an interim report
OL,20,Fby February 2027, with a final report
OL,21,Fdue in spring 2027.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
