OL,3,GNEWSASenior judge to review trial of
OL,4,Athe facts after Donaldson case
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department of Justice said the
OL,7,Freview would examine a range of
OL,8,Ffactors, including whether a
OL,9,Fconventional criminal trial should
OL,10,Fremain possible if an individual
OL,11,Fbecomes fit to plead.
